## Conventions

- Focused diffs; no unrelated refactors.
- Extend parsers via **`commentHeatmap.js`** / **`socialInteractionGraph.js`** patterns.
- **GSAP only** for motion.
- Quips on dark slides: `SLIDE_INSIGHT_PUNCH_ON_DARK`.

## API (backend, optional)

- `GET /health` → `{ "ok": true }`
- `POST /upload` — legacy Non-Followers (not in UI)
